### =============================================================================
### ClinicSlot REST Client Testing Script (VS Code REST Client)
### =============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
# @baseUrl = https://clinicslot-api.vercel.app/api

### 1. Health Check (T-H01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Search Doctors by Specialty (T-B01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors?specialty=Cardiology

### 3. List Specialties
GET {{baseUrl}}/specialties

### 4. Patient Registration (T-X04: role tampering test)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-Turnstile-Token: 1x00000000000000000000AA

{
  "fullName": "Test Patient",
  "email": "testpatient@example.com",
  "phone": "+201099887766",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### 5. Patient Login
# @name loginPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient@clinicslot.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Save Patient Token
@patientToken = {{loginPatient.response.body.token}}

### 7. Receptionist Login
# @name loginReception
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reception@clinicslot.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 8. Save Receptionist Token
@receptionToken = {{loginReception.response.body.token}}

### 9. Admin Login
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@clinicslot.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 10. Save Admin Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 11. View Doctor Free Slots (S2 slotService test)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors/d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/slots?date=2026-11-25

### 12. Book Appointment (T-B02)
# @name bookAppointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
X-Turnstile-Token: 1x00000000000000000000AA

{
  "doctorId": "d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "startTime": "2026-11-25T09:00:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Chest tightness and annual consultation"
}

### 13. Save Appointment ID
@appointmentId = {{bookAppointment.response.body.id}}

### 14. Double Booking Attempt (T-B04: Expected 409 SLOT_TAKEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
X-Turnstile-Token: 1x00000000000000000000AA

{
  "doctorId": "d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "startTime": "2026-11-25T09:00:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Trying to book same slot"
}

### 15. View My Appointments (Patient only sees own bookings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 16. Receptionist Daily Schedule Overview (T-R01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules?date=2026-11-25
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}

### 17. Receptionist Check-in Patient (T-R01)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}

{
  "status": "CheckedIn"
}

### 18. Invalid Status Transition: Cancelled -> CheckedIn (Expected 409 INVALID_STATUS_CHANGE)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionToken}}

{
  "status": "Booked"
}

### 19. Admin Import Egyptian Public Holidays (Nager.Date External API Integration)
POST {{baseUrl}}/holidays?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 20. View Audit Trail (Admin only - T-X02: Patient gets 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
